{#
  BeMart profile-change-complete page — EC-CUBE
  goMypageChangeComplete (mypage_change_complete).

  PORT of EC-CUBE 4.3 default-theme `Mypage/change_complete.twig`
  (src/Eccube/Resource/template/default/Mypage/change_complete.twig).

  DATA page (no form) — the data-page recipe (see var/templates/
  README.md). EC-CUBE shows this static confirmation after a successful
  `doUpdateCustomer` (mypage_change). Markup skeleton, `ec-mypageRole` /
  `ec-pageHeader` / `ec-registerCompleteRole` / `ec-reportHeading` /
  `ec-off2Grid` / `ec-text-ac` / `ec-reportDescription` / `ec-off4Grid`
  classes + the block structure are kept verbatim from EC-CUBE.

  Mypage/navi.twig -> the shared partial `Page/Mypage/navi.html.twig`.

  EC-CUBE-ism rebinding (see var/templates/README.md):
   - `{{ 'key'|trans }}` -> the ja literal from messages.ja.yaml.
   - `canonical-url 'homepage')` -> deterministic `/homepage` (BeMartTwigExtension).
   - The Mypage navi welcome line reads `name01`/`name02`; the
     ChangeComplete resource is a thin pure renderer with no
     session-bound customer context, so the name is a MISSING BODY FIELD
     follow-up — the welcome renders the empty name, exactly as EC-CUBE
     renders for a missing `app.user`.
#}
{% extends 'base.html.twig' %}

{% set body_class = 'mypage' %}
{% set route = 'mypage-change-complete' %}
{% set title = 'マイページ' %}

{% block main %}
    <div class="ec-layoutRole__main">
        <div class="ec-mypageRole">
            <div class="ec-pageHeader">
                <h1>マイページ/会員情報編集(完了)</h1>
            </div>
            {% include 'Page/Mypage/navi.html.twig' with { mypageno: 'change', name01: name01|default(''), name02: name02|default('') } %}
        </div>
        <div class="ec-registerCompleteRole">
            <div class="ec-reportHeading">
                <h2>会員登録内容の変更が完了いたしました</h2>
            </div>
            <div class="ec-off2Grid ec-text-ac">
                <div class="ec-off2Grid__cell">
                    <p class="ec-reportDescription">それでは、引き続きショッピングをお楽しみください。</p>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="ec-off4Grid">
                <div class="ec-off4Grid__cell">
                    <a class="ec-blockBtn--cancel" href="/">戻る</a>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
{% endblock %}
